"Read from Claude Code's own records: each reply says whether it cached for an hour or five minutes, and a cache lasts that long from the last request that used it. That is the time if nothing before it has changed — switching model, changing tools or compacting starts a new cache. Subagents keep caches of their own and are not listed." = "数据来自 Claude Code 自己的记录。每次回复都会注明缓存保留 1 小时还是 5 分钟，从最后一次用到它的请求算起。这是上下文没变时的时长：换模型、改工具或压缩对话，都会重新开始一份缓存。子 Agent 有自己的缓存，这里不列出。";
