"Read from Codex's own records: the model each request used, and when it was sent. On GPT-5.6 and later, OpenAI keeps a cache available for at least 30 minutes after it was last used, and may keep it longer — so this is the time it is guaranteed, not when it ends. Earlier models have no stated lifetime and are not listed. Under heavy traffic a request can still miss within this time." = "数据来自 Codex 自己的记录：每次请求用的模型和发出时间。OpenAI 保证 GPT-5.6 及之后的模型，缓存在最后一次使用后至少保留 30 分钟，实际可能更久，所以这里显示的是保底时间，不是确切的过期时间。更早的模型官方没给时长，这里不列出。请求很密集时，即使在这段时间内也可能没命中。";
